L36: Serum glucose levels were significantly lower in the BRJ+vitamin C group compared to placebo both pre-test (72.0 ± 6.7 mg/dl vs. 82.6 ± 9.0 mg/dl, P < 0.001) and post-test (96.3 ± 19.2 mg/dl vs. 112.5 ± 20.4 mg/dl, P < 0.001) (Table 4). No significant differences were observed for CK or LDH levels in pre-test, post-test, or 24 h post-test (P ≥ 0.05). No intervention-by-time interactions or carryover effects were detected (P > 0.05).
